config MMI_SMBCHARGER_IIO
	tristate "Motorola SMB charger IIO driver"
	depends on POWER_SUPPLY
	help
	  Motorola charger driver for the SMB5 family, exposing the charging
	  state used by the fogos charger and USB stack.

	  Say Y to build it into the kernel.
